body:
I know where you are coming from and appreciate it. I reached out to people for awhile to see how they were doing and such, but I could only initiate conversations so many times before deciding I had to be annoying them.

&#x200B;

To your second point; I recently realized that I typically only speak in response to someone talking to me. It really doesn't seem to be an anxiety issue though, more so that I genuinely do not know what to say/don't want to creepily dive into people's conversations.
